Z||000010||AusFiero||09-07-2001||05:29 PM||||First to answer Pontiac4me. If you left a deposit now you would still be looking at 5 weeks with the waiting list I have. Maybe sooner. Other projects I am not going to promise any time frames on as I have been pushing myself too hard and frankly am not very well of late because of it. Brain specialist was not very happy with me last Tuesday when I went to see him. So I am just kicking back for a couple of weeks regaining my strength. The rest is in my glass guys hands now.<P>Am still taking an shipping orders on small stuff but I have to lay off the development a bit. I finally got to see the printer about the gauge faces by the way. The tests look good and soon as I make some more precise artwork they are going into production. The wing stantions are only a small job and are actually sitting ready to take moulds off. I might play with them next being nothing major. <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
