Z||000012||AusFiero||09-07-2001||06:46 PM||||Glad you understand. I will just be glad when the scoops start shipping so I can clear the backlog. The income from them wont hurt either. But all up to my glass guy now. I wont push him because good glass shops are hard to find around here. Did some stuff in my garage but the smell through the house did not impress my wife. My workshop OI cant use without spending mega dollars on a spraybooth so work cover doesnt fine me. Think I will let the workshop go for now and just get a lot of the small things out of the way while the glass guy does scoops.||||reg||1
